Nivel de vechime: Începător
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Dezvoltare de software și Dezvoltare de software personalizat pentru sisteme IT
As a Power BI Developer , you will play a key role in transforming data into valuable business insights through the development and enhancement of dashboards and reporting solutions. 🚀 Collaborating with cross-functional teams, you will help drive informed decision-making in a dynamic and fast-paced environment.
 🎯 What you will do: 
 🔹 We are looking for a motivated Power BI Developer to support the design, development, and maintenance of Power BI solutions;
 🔹 The role involves transforming data into meaningful insights, creating dashboards, and supporting data-driven decision-making across teams;
 🔹 You will be a part of the Information Systems Division and you will work alongside a team of project managers, analysts, and PMO professionals.
 👤 Profile: 
 ✅ Solid experience working with Power BI (Desktop & Service);
 ✅ Proven experience in Power BI development, including building reports and dashboards in Power BI Desktop and Service;
 ✅ Ideally, understanding of data modeling concepts (facts, dimensions, relationships);
 ✅ Comfortable working with Excel (advanced formulas, pivot tables);
 ✅ Strong analytical and problem-solving skills;
 ✅ Basic understanding of data visualization best practices;
 ✅ Advanced in both English and French;
 ✅ A responsible attitude and ambition in achieving your mission;
 ✅ A good combination of rigor, creativity, and communication skills;
 ✅ Enthusiasm, self-confidence, innovative problem-solving skills, curiosity, autonomy, and a strong desire to continuously develop your skills.
 This role is a great opportunity to develop your Power BI and data analytics skills in a collaborative environment. 📈 If you are analytical, motivated, and eager to learn, you will have the chance to grow professionally while contributing to data-driven decision-making and impactful business outcomes. ✨
